.TH NEO-COMPASS 1 "2026-11-10" "gnome-phone 0.1.0" "GNOME Phone"
.SH NAME
neo-compass \- compass for GNOME Phone
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B neo-compass
.SH DESCRIPTION
Shows which way the phone points, with the heading from iio-sensor-proxy's compass, and the position from GeoClue.
.SH SEE ALSO
iio-sensor-proxy(1)
